WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open the editable cylindrical lantern sample.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Frame the drawing, then orbit to reveal its curved strokes.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Orbit around the lantern to see how the marks wrap through three dimensions.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Select one stroke with V. Move it with G, then undo and redo to compare.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Inspect the edited stroke from a second angle; the drawing remains editable.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Save a separate copy to keep the original sample unchanged.
